<title>UK: SBC sets warrants on Amgold.</title>
<headline>SBC sets warrants on Amgold.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>SBC Warburg is placing 7.5 million American-style call warrants, on Amgold Gold Mining Company, for the issuer Swiss Bank Corp.</p>
<p>One share is controlled by 10 warrants.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    280 ZAR		   PREMIUM	24.08 CHF</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     1.45 CHF		  GEARING	5.81 X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	28.DEC.98		 PAYDATE	22.JUL.97</p>
<p> MIN EXER LOT    10			  SPOT REF     262 ZAR</p>
<p> NOTES</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
